// ============================================================================
// fec_ghost.kn — TurboKain alien suite 04: Blind Soft Dual-Code Distinguisher
// (THE KEYSTONE — defeats Shannon camouflage)
//
// WHY THIS EXISTS: capacity-achieving links are power/entropy/cyclostationarity
// silent by design (p(y)~CN(0,s2), symmetric constellations => bicoherence 0,
// long interleaves => no frame lines). The one thing a coded link cannot
// randomize away without killing its own coding gain is its PARITY CONSTRAINTS:
// any linear (n,k) code has a non-empty dual, so some sparse parity mask MUST
// bias. Random noise violates every mask at 50%. Coded soft bits satisfy their
// dual masks with bias. We hunt the ghost of the code, not power excess.
//
// STATISTIC (soft-syndrome / boxplus — code-agnostic dual correlation):
//   front end: soft symbols y (1 sample = 1 symbol, stated assumption),
//     derotated by --dechirp-hz-s residual r (argv data, never re-searched):
//     two branches z = x*2cos(phi), x*2sin(phi), phi = pi*r*(i/fs)^2.
//     r == 0 uses the cos branch only (sin branch is identically zero).
//   bank: 256 fixed sparse masks, EVEN weights w in {6,8,10,12} (even-weight
//     masks are invariant under global BPSK sign flip — unknown carrier phase
//     cannot erase them), spans L in {16,32,64,128,256}, deterministic LCG taps.
//   per (mask, shift 0..7, 4096-symbol block): S = mean of boxplus products
//     P = PROD_t tanh(clip(y_{pos+s+t})/2s2^0.5..) with winsorized y (|y|<=3s)
//     and MAD-floored s2 (floor 1e-9). z = S*sqrt(B)/s0, s0 = m2^(w/2) with
//     m2 = mean tanh^2 (theoretical null unit from data moments — winsorized,
//     never a global measured MAD that a strong signal could poison).
//   gate: max |z| over masks*shifts*blocks*branches trials, Bonferroni
//     (Holm-equivalent for the top hit) at --p-fa (default 1e-6) via
//     closed-form normal tail tables (no erf needed).
//
// LOAD-BEARING GATES (before any GHOST claim):
//   hum pre-veto (22.35 Hz family autocorr vs local lags, needs --fs) ->
//     QUARANTINE-HUM. --stamp <stamp.csv> must exist + contain NON-NULL or the
//     verdict caps at RESIDUE (ghost fires + stamp null). --off leg runs the
//     IDENTICAL pipeline; OFF match on (mask,shift) -> COMMON-CODE, census
//     match (--census data file, never baked constants) -> TERRESTRIAL-CODE.
//
// Front-end honesty: v1 (hard bits + (n,interleave) grid, 1e3-1e5 trials) was
// KILLED in debate (Bonferroni death + hard-slice erasure at 0 dB + DVB-S2 RFI
// amplification). v2 is soft-only, O(256*8) trials, gated. No grid search here.
//
// CSV: mask_id,weight,len,block_idx,shift,S_x10000,sigma_x100,p_corr_log10,
//   best,verdict. Verdicts: GHOST / TERRESTRIAL-CODE / COMMON-CODE / RESIDUE /
//   CLEAN / QUARANTINE-HUM. Exits 0 ok / 1 help-or-prove-FAIL / 2 error.
//   --fs is MANDATORY (M7, fold_sum lesson). Scaled ints only in CSV.
// ============================================================================

